About WPP Production

We are WPP Production - the unified global production company that brings together all of WPP's content producers, studios and craft experts into one connected organisation. We combine world-class human craft with next generation technology to originate, design, and deliver multi-channel content systems at scale. Built for borderless collaboration and powered by deep craft expertise, we are the production engine designed for today's always on, AI driven marketing world.

About WPP

WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. We unite&nbsp;cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel&nbsp;in a single company -&nbsp;powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open,&nbsp;to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit&nbsp; WPP.com .

A Hybrid working model

We believe the best work happens when we're together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That's why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.

What does a AI Artist do at WPP Production? &nbsp;
 

WPP Production is seeking a highly skilled and visionary&nbsp; AI Artist to join our dynamic post-production team. This role requires a creative professional with exceptional expertise in leveraging artificial intelligence tools for image and video generation, narrative storytelling, video editing and the conceptualization of advertising pieces. The ideal candidate will be responsible for driving innovation through cutting-edge AI technologies while maintaining a strong foundation in art direction, audiovisual narrative, and advertising creativity. &nbsp;

As an AI Artist, you will play a pivotal role in creating visually compelling content that aligns with client objectives and elevates brand storytelling. You will collaborate closely with multidisciplinary teams to design, edit, and deliver high-quality advertising materials across various formats, ensuring excellence in execution and creativity. &nbsp;

&nbsp;

Key Responsibilities &nbsp;

AI Image &amp; Video Generation: &nbsp;

• Utilize generative AI tools (e.g., MidJourney, Runway, LTX, ComfyUI, etc) to create innovative visual assets for advertising campaigns. &nbsp;

• Experiment with AI-driven techniques to produce original and impactful imagery and videos. &nbsp;

Conceptualization &amp; Art Direction: &nbsp;

• Lead the creative development of advertising animatics, including concept ideation, visual storytelling, and overall artistic direction. &nbsp;

• Collaborate with clients, directors and internal teams to ensure alignment with project goals and brand identity. &nbsp;

Motion Graphics Integration: &nbsp;

• Design and incorporate motion graphics into audiovisual projects to enhance storytelling and engagement. &nbsp;

• Develop dynamic animations and transitions using Adobe After Effects and other relevant software. &nbsp;

Audiovisual Narrative Direction: &nbsp;

• Oversee the creation of storyboards and animatics to visualize concepts and guide production workflows. &nbsp;

• Provide creative input on editing and narrative structure to craft compelling advertising stories. &nbsp;

Editing &amp; Post-Production: &nbsp;

• Edit videos for advertising and corporate purposes using Adobe Premiere Pro and other editing tools. &nbsp;

• Ensure seamless integration of AI-generated assets with traditional post-production elements. &nbsp;

Presentation Design &amp; Pitching: &nbsp;

• Create visually stunning presentations to pitch ideas and concepts to clients and stakeholders. &nbsp;

• Communicate creative visions effectively during client meetings and internal reviews. &nbsp;

